      "ingredientDeclaration": "Durum Wheat Semolina, Water, Ricotta Cheese (11%) (Whey (Milk), Salt, Food Acid (Acetic Acid)), Breadcrumbs (Wheat Flour, Yeast, Sugar, Salt, Wheat Gluten), Beef (7%), Onion (6%), Caramelised Onion (4.5%), Dried Potato, Egg, Salt, Flavour, Garlic (1%), Brown Sugar, Vegetable Oil (1%), Basil (0.5%), Wheat Fibre, Caramelised Sugar.{b}Contains wheat, gluten, milk, egg.{/b} 1. Bring a large pot of water to a boil, and pour in your pasta. 2. Reduce to a simmer and cook for a further 3 minutes, stirring occasionally and season to taste. 3. Drain the pasta and serve with your preferred sauces, oil, or garnishes. 4. Enjoy your delicious 25° South pasta. Pasta must be cooked before consumption.",
